# Getting there

The [University of Helsinki main building (Fabianinkatu 33)](https://tilavaraus.helsinki.fi/en/city-centre/main-building-fabianinkatu-33) is near the
[metro station _University of Helsinki_](https://maps.app.goo.gl/8qfPZmCxYURwpa3a7) and
[tram stop _Senaatintori (Senate square)_](https://maps.app.goo.gl/8qfPZmCxYURwpa3a7).
Enter from the Senate square's side. The seminar room U4062 is on the 4th floor.
